24:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Start with the current eligible-course list",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Start with the current eligible-course list"}],[["$","p","DAAD's database checked on 28 October 2026 links the EPOS course list with 2027/2028 deadlines. Choose an eligible course from that list, then check its own scholarship deadline and entry rules; the general EPOS listing has no common closing date.",{"children":"DAAD's database checked on 28 October 2026 links the EPOS course list with 2027/2028 deadlines. Choose an eligible course from that list, then check its own scholarship deadline and entry rules; the general EPOS listing has no common closing date."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www2.daad.de/deutschland/stipendium/datenbank/en/21148-scholarship-database/?detail=50076777",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www2.daad.de/deutschland/stipendium/datenbank/en/21148-scholarship-database/?detail=50076777","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"DAAD: EPOS course list and application procedure"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Check country and experience requirements",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check country and experience requirements"}],[["$","p","Check DAAD's eligible-country list and the course's academic criteria. EPOS normally requires at least two years of related professional experience after the bachelor's degree by application time. Record dates and obtain employment evidence; student status alone does not satisfy that experience condition.",{"children":"Check DAAD's eligible-country list and the course's academic criteria. EPOS normally requires at least two years of related professional experience after the bachelor's degree by application time. Record dates and obtain employment evidence; student status alone does not satisfy that experience condition."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","3-Deadlines are course-specific",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Deadlines are course-specific"}],[["$","p","The 2027–2028 calendar differs across eligible postgraduate courses. Record the deadline stated for your course, the time zone and the receiving institution. An old DAAD table or a date from another course is not a valid substitute.",{"children":"The 2027–2028 calendar differs across eligible postgraduate courses. Record the deadline stated for your course, the time zone and the receiving institution. An old DAAD table or a date from another course is not a valid substitute."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","4-Where the application is submitted",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Where the application is submitted"}],[["$","p","Apply directly to the selected course. DAAD permits up to three course choices and requires a consistent priority order and motivation statement. Candidates proposed by a course are subsequently invited to upload documents to the DAAD portal; sending the first application to DAAD does not replace the course submission.",{"children":"Apply directly to the selected course. DAAD permits up to three course choices and requires a consistent priority order and motivation statement. Candidates proposed by a course are subsequently invited to upload documents to the DAAD portal; sending the first application to DAAD does not replace the course submission."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c"]}]
